## 📖 About The Project

Finding a reliable plumber, electrician, or carpenter shouldn't be a hassle. **MindFind** is a modern, full-stack web application designed to bridge the gap between homeowners and skilled professionals. 

Whether you need a quick repair or a major renovation, MindFind provides a seamless, secure, and intuitive experience to post requests, receive competitive offers, and communicate in real-time.

### ✨ Key Features
- 👥 **Role-Based Access Control (RBAC):** Dedicated, optimized dashboards for Clients, Workers (Tradespeople), and System Administrators.
- ⚡ **Real-Time Chat:** Instant, persistent messaging between clients and workers powered by Socket.io.
- 📝 **Dynamic Request & Offer System:** Clients post detailed job requests with categories and locations; workers submit competitive, transparent bids.
- ⭐ **Reviews & Ratings:** Build trust and reputation through a transparent, verified feedback system.
- 📱 **Fully Responsive UI:** Beautiful, mobile-first interface built with Tailwind CSS, ensuring a perfect experience on any device.
- 🔒 **Enterprise-Grade Security:** JWT authentication, bcrypt password hashing, CORS protection, and secure API routes.

---

## 🏗️ Architecture & Tech Stack

MindFind is built as a robust Monorepo, separating concerns for maximum maintainability and scalability.

| Layer | Technologies & Tools |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend** | React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router v6, Axios, Context API |
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express.js, Socket.io, JWT, bcrypt |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (with native, version-controlled SQL migrations) |
| **Deployment** | Nginx (Reverse Proxy), Systemd (Process Management), Let's Encrypt (SSL/TLS) |
| **DevOps** | Git, GitHub Actions (Ready for CI/CD) |

### 📂 Project Structure
```text
mindfind/
├── client/                 # 🎨 React Frontend (Vite)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── components/     # Reusable UI components (Navbar, Cards, Modals)
│   │   ├── pages/          # Route components (Home, Dashboards, Chat, Auth)
│   │   ├── context/        # Global state management (AuthContext)
│   │   └── api/            # Centralized Axios API clients
├── server/                 # ⚙️ Node.js Backend (Express)
│   ├── src/
│   │   ├── routes/         # RESTful API endpoints (auth, requests, chat, etc.)
│   │   ├── middleware/     # Auth verification, error handling, validation
│   │   ├── sockets/        # Socket.io real-time event handlers
│   │   └── migrate.js      # Database schema initialization script
├── deploy/                 # 🚀 Production configurations
│   ├── sergiumind-api.service  # Systemd service file
│   └── sergiumind.nginx.conf   # Nginx reverse proxy & SSL config
└── .gitignore            # Security rules (ignores node_modules, .env, dist)
```

